{"id":"000VHI","title":"Whispers of the Heavens","author":"starchacer","solvedCount":9,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 14. Oktober 2026, 04:18 Uhr","rules":"A better version of the Kanji I was trying to make last time. Please enjoy a short trip to Heaven. As always, feedback is appreciated.\n\n• Normal Sudoku Rules: Fill each row, column, and 3x3 box with the digits 1-9 once each.\n\n• White Kropkis: Digits in cells separated by a white dot are consecutive.\n\n• German Whispers: Along green lines, digits must differ from their neighbors by at least 5.\n\n• Little Killers: Numbers outside the grid give the sum of all cells along the diagonal pointed to by the arrow.\n\n• Region Sum Lines: Box borders divide blue region sum lines into segments, each of which have the same value.\n\n• Anti-King: Cells which are a (chess) king's move apart cannot share the same digit.\n\n• Odd: Digits in gray circles are odd.\n\n• Minimum Cells: Gray boxes marked with inward-pointing indicators show that the center value is strictly less than all orthogonal cells.\n\nPlay online at Solve Paths\n\nPlay online using Sudokupad","solutionCode":"Row 3 from left to right.","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Little Killer (Variante)","German Whispers (Variante)","Region Sum Lines (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/7p3fh61x6w","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/7p3fh61x6w","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","arrows","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}